- 原来只有 160000 的 gitlink、没有 .gitmodules ⇒ 别人 clone 不到、git status 也不正常
- 现补 .gitmodules 指向真实上游 vc-teahouse/Baseband-guard（GPL-2.0），提交 a5b57f15d6b5 已核实存在
- 它是构建真依赖（CONFIG_BBG => security/baseband-guard/），不是残留，所以不能一删了之
---
 .gitmodules    | 3 +++
 Baseband-guard | 1 +
 2 files changed, 4 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 .gitmodules
 create mode 160000 Baseband-guard

diff --git a/.gitmodules b/.gitmodules
new file mode 100644
index 000000000000..6b2904dbca60
--- /dev/null
+++ b/.gitmodules
@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@
+[submodule "Baseband-guard"]
+	path = Baseband-guard
+	url = https://github.com/vc-teahouse/Baseband-guard.git
diff --git a/Baseband-guard b/Baseband-guard
new file mode 160000
index 000000000000..a5b57f15d6b5
--- /dev/null
+++ b/Baseband-guard
@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+Subproject commit a5b57f15d6b597a1bd157c42330fe80020b1d628
